Z||000009||Ken Wittlief||05-23-2001||11:00 AM||||take the more subtle appoach, when he comes over you and her dad are at the kitchen table cleaning your gun collections. Dont make any threatening remarks, dont say anything to embarrase his daughter.<P>  Knowing her dad and friends are gun collectors will put the fear of God in him all by itself - besides, you never know - the kid may grow up to be the next Bill Gates - you dont want to scare them all off.<p>[This message has been edited by Ken Wittlief (edited 05-23-2001).]||||reg||1
